sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + single-swamp-node; DECISIONS R3 (root password by server vault key), 5 (swamp role SSH identity), round 2 bugs (always-run cleanup).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as DB server Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: database:create<br/>{slug: shop, server: mysql-1}
  Note over GW: Validate, make password<br/>record connection + task
  GW->>SW: Store owner password<br/>database-create-intent-5121
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-database-create
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5121
  SW->>N: Copy action scripts<br/>@swamp/ssh · swamp role identity
  SW->>N: Create owner, database<br/>vault.get server key, owner key
  Note over N: Probe, create user, grant<br/>create database in container
  Note over SW: Remove /tmp scripts<br/>always-run step, pass or fail
  alt every action exits 0
    N-->>SW: exit 0 per action
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + outputs
    Note over GW: Connection active<br/>attach to Instance if instance_id
  else an action fails
    N--xSW: exit 1, step output
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5121
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
